   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "You intend to invest four annual payments, starting immediately: $10,000 now, another $10,000 at the end of year 1, $12,000 at the end of year 2, and $15,000 at the end of year 3. How much will you have at the end of year 4 if the fund is always earning 6% compounded annually?",
